# Who reviews what (fact-24).
#
# The default owner reviews the catalog machinery — schema, workflows, scripts,
# docs — and every new template's first pull request.
* @getkrafter/core

# One line per template, so an update to someone's template goes to them:
#
#   /templates/<id>/ @<github-user>
#
# Official templates stay with the core team; a community template names its
# author. The id is the folder name, which is also the manifest id.

